{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/d67f8bab3afa689d417702293f127458.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/d67f8bab3afa689d417702293f127458.apng?t=1747410139\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=82 /></picture></span><br>A 2D side-scrolling fast-paced hack and slash/action RPG, exploring the classes of each character, fluid movements, evasion, special attacks, and everything that creates a pleasant gaming experience. Many varied environments, each with its own unique enemies and bosses, keeping the challenge constant.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/7e4722fee14a5851e68191b45840cd92.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/7e4722fee14a5851e68191b45840cd92.webm?t=1747410139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/7e4722fee14a5851e68191b45840cd92.mp4?t=1747410139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/bc0d7947d2cf2afa9358ea73860b201d.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/bc0d7947d2cf2afa9358ea73860b201d.apng?t=1747410139\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=82 /></picture></span><br><strong>Save My Human</strong> tells the story of a little girl kicking butt in a video game, but the monsters within the game begin to perceive her as a threat and subsequently kidnap her, bringing her into the digital world of the game. However, her dog manages to quickly follow her and enter the game for the rescue. Upon awakening with warrior powers and observing the dangerous world around them, the dog realizes that the quest will not be easy. Fortunately, they are not alone, as other pets have also entered to save their owners. The adventure starts here as they strive to save their humans!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/aa3ed62be6531ab28c8bc0de5c8224d4.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/aa3ed62be6531ab28c8bc0de5c8224d4.webm?t=1747410139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/aa3ed62be6531ab28c8bc0de5c8224d4.mp4?t=1747410139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/1e9ba675095416c21e51342324feface.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/1e9ba675095416c21e51342324feface.apng?t=1747410139\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=101 /></picture></span><br>The squad is made up of the turtle mage, the druid frog, the warrior dog, the archer cat, and the lancer rabbit, each one searching for their human.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/2ae706672444d23ffdca88b4e823e546.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/2ae706672444d23ffdca88b4e823e546.webm?t=1747410139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/c7e57163644f0b7119b5cd75d6e03d5e.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/c7e57163644f0b7119b5cd75d6e03d5e.apng?t=1747410139\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=82 /></picture></span><br>- Characters with different classes: dog warrior, cat archer, turtle mage, rabbit lancer, and frog druid. Maybe more?<br>- Combat: dodge roll/teleport, skills and a special attack for each character.<br>- Collectibles and consumables to upgrade and customize your gameplay.<br>- Effects system with burning, slowing, poisoning, and stunning effects, increasing the dynamics of the battle system.<br>- Big bosses with a diverse range of attacks and a fast pace, which may pose a challenging experience.<br>- A special character selection system that aligns gameplay style with the storytelling.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/b10987da6cf4efb849e24407f06504d0.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/b10987da6cf4efb849e24407f06504d0.webm?t=1747410139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/b10987da6cf4efb849e24407f06504d0.mp4?t=1747410139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/d73b7f01c466174cc0d8d82c9767c210.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/d73b7f01c466174cc0d8d82c9767c210.apng?t=1747410139\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=82 /></picture></span><br>Some are wished and some are already in development:<br>- Skins system: Why not put YOUR cat to play as an archer?<br>- Puzzle mechanics integrated into the gameplay: Sometimes using force isn't always the best way to progress.<br>- Mini challenges: Defeat a mini-boss, achieve time-limited goals, protect something valuable; these challenges can provide additional achievements.<br>- Pet of the pet: Can a human become a pet in this situation?<br>- Battle modes: If combat is your main goal, let's add some extra fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/ae3722982ca5149b78592e050c2d13fa.poster.avif?t=1747410139\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/extras/ae3722982ca5149b78592e050c2d13fa.webm?t=1747410139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2486530?t=1747410139","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2486530?t=1747410139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747410139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747410139","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_su